sequenceDiagram
    participant Customer
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant Loan as Loan Application Service
    participant Outbox as Transactional Outbox
    participant DB as Loan DB
    participant Kafka as Event Bus (Kafka)
    participant WF as Workflow Service (Camunda)

    Customer->>API: Submit loan application
    API->>Loan: Create loan application (REST)
    Loan->>DB: Begin transaction
    Loan->>DB: Persist loan state (CREATED)
    Loan->>Outbox: Write APPLICATION_CREATED event to outbox
    DB-->>Loan: Commit transaction (state + event)
    Loan->>Kafka: Publish APPLICATION_CREATED event
    Kafka-->>WF: Event consumed
    Kafka-->>API: Event captured (async)
    WF-->>WF: Start loan workflow (BPMN)
    Loan-->>API: Loan application ID returned
    API-->>Customer: {applicationId, status: CREATED}
